<item>
 <title>overview</title>
 <link>http://akkada.tivi.net.pl/nms/index.php?q=node/2</link>
 <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;white&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://trianus.pl&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;b&gt;akk@da&lt;/b&gt; is a network monitoring system designed for small and middle-sized computer networks. Its purpose is to quickly detect system or network fault and to display information about detected problem for an administrator. &lt;b&gt;akk@da&lt;/b&gt; is designed as a pro-active network monitor.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
